        <mxCell id="c213" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Reconciliations, with the Year filter on 2026 for the matrix and the cards and on the 3 years of the window for the billing table; rows are 20 px here. The matrix is one visual drawn in two panes, columns 1 to 6 and the rest after scrolling right, with long headings broken over two lines. Outlined in coral: the JournalEntry column, which no subledger document supports, and the two differences. The Findings table lists its rows in the order of its first column. Total rows, the sales tax matrix and the page&#x27;s text box are not drawn.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="904" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
